OL,3,GNEWSAGreen deputy leader questioned on
OL,4,Asmall boats and polling on BBC local
OL,5,Aradio
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe is taking part in a series of
OL,8,Fquick-fire interviews on BBC local
OL,9,Fradio stations as her party prepares to
OL,10,Fhost its autumn conference in Brighton
OL,11,Ffrom Friday
OL,13,FThe BBC local radio round has been a
OL,14,Fpre-conference tradition for many
OL,15,Fyears. The Conservatives, Greens,
OL,16,FLabour and Reform are all getting a
OL,17,Fsimilar opportunity before their
OL,18,Fconferences
OL,20,FMillward is being interviewed on seven
OL,21,Fstations across England - watch live at
OL,22,Fthe top of this page
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
